{"id":9,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\docs\\found_issues.md\n-- 214 lines, 9612 bytes --\n 1 | # Found Issues (2025-06-28)\n 2 | \n 3 | ## 1. Reflection positivity lemma was stated with too-weak hypothesis\n 4 | \n 5 | ### What was wrong\n 6 | \n 7 | The lemma `gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive` in\n 8 | `ReflectionPositivity.lean` originally claimed:\n 9 | \n10 | ```lean4\n11 | lemma gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n12 |     (hT : Odd T) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ) :\n13 |     0 ≤ gibbsExpectation N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n14 |       (λ U => f U * reflectObservable N f U) := ...\n15 | ```\n16 | \n17 | This claims that for **any** function `f` (depending on all link variables),\n18 | the integral `∫ f(U)·f(θU)·exp(-β·S_W(U)) dμ₀(U)` is non-negative.\n19 | \n20 | This is **mathematically false**. A counterexample exists even for β=0 (free theory):\n21 | \n22 | Take a positive-site link ℓ and its reflection θℓ (a distinct negative-site link).\n23 | Define:\n24 | ```\n25 | f(U) = a(U(ℓ))·b(U(θℓ)) - a(U(θℓ))·b(U(ℓ))\n26 | ```\n27 | for non-zero functions a,b: SU(N) → ℝ.\n28 | \n29 | Then `f(θU) = -f(U)`, so `f·θf = -(f)² ≤ 0`, and the integral is strictly negative.\n30 | \n31 | ### The fix\n32 | \n33 | The correct Osterwalder-Schrader theorem requires `f` to depend only on links in\n34 | the **positive-time region** (including the interface at time 0).  The predicate\n35 | `dependsOnlyOnPosInterface` enforces this:\n36 | \n37 | ```lean4\n38 | def dependsOnlyOnPosInterface (N T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n39 |     (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ) : Prop :=\n40 |   ∀ (U V : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)),\n41 |     (∀ (n : PeriodicSite T L) (μ : Fin 4),\n42 |       n ∈ (positiveSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L) → U.value n μ = V.value n μ) → f U = f V\n43 | ```\n44 | \n45 | The lemma now takes `(hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosInterface N T L f)` as an\n46 | additional hypothesis.\n47 | \n48 | ### Impact\n49 | \n50 | - `PeriodicExpectation.reflectionPositive` field now requires the hypothesis.\n\n... 164 more line(s) below (use offset=51 to continue reading)","timestamp":1784912623,"token_count":681,"tool_call_id":"8dcddd73-2fa6-4361-9db2-06f748102fad","full_token_estimate":516,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"docs/found_issues.md","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":214,"byte_count":9612,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":2,"is_prune_marker":false}
