f g_posInterface (N T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (hT : Odd T) (β : ℝ)\n1235 | \n1236 |     (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n1237 | \n1238 |     (u : PosInterfaceConfig N T L) : ℝ :=\n1239 | \n1240 |   f (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L) u) *\n1241 | \n1242 |     Real.exp (-β * osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u / 2)\n1243 | \n1244 | \n1245 | \n\n... 1367 more line(s) below (use offset=1246 to continue reading)","timestamp":1784912867,"token_count":746,"tool_call_id":"c636bf00-9d73-4999-8ced-e6e5da741574","full_token_estimate":565,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/TransferMatrix.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":2612,"byte_count":88303,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":6,"is_prune_marker":false}
