{"id":32,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Lattice.lean\n-- 351 lines, 12085 bytes --\n235 | \n236 | The inverse for the third and fourth links accounts for the orientation\n237 | reversal (traversing the link backwards).\n238 | -/\n239 | noncomputable def plaquetteProduct (N : ℕ) {Λ : Type} [AddVector Λ]\n240 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ) (n : Λ) (μ ν : Fin 4) : SU N :=\n241 |   U.value n μ *\n242 |   U.value (AddVector.addVector n μ) ν *\n243 |   (U.value (AddVector.addVector (AddVector.addVector n μ) ν) μ)⁻¹ *\n244 |   (U.value (AddVector.addVector n ν) ν)⁻¹\n245 | \n246 | /--\n247 | The contribution of a single oriented plaquette to the Wilson action:\n248 | \n249 |     S_p = β (1 - (1/N) Re Tr(U_∂p))\n250 | \n251 | where U_∂p is the plaquette product. For SU(N) matrices, Tr(U) ∈ ℂ and\n252 | Re Tr(U) ∈ ℝ. The term (1 - (1/N) Re Tr) is non-negative and vanishes when\n253 | U_∂p = 1.\n254 | -/\n255 | noncomputable def plaquetteContribution (N : ℕ) (β : ℝ) {Λ : Type} [AddVector Λ]\n256 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ) (n : Λ) (μ ν : Fin 4) : ℝ :=\n257 |   β * ((1 : ℝ) - (1 / (N : ℝ)) * ((trace ((plaquetteProduct N U n μ ν : Matrix (Fin N) (Fin N) ℂ))).re))\n258 | \n259 | /--\n260 | The total Wilson action for a finite set of lattice sites.\n261 | For each site n ∈ sites, sum over all oriented plaquettes (n; μ, ν).\n262 | \n263 | Explicitly:\n264 |     S_W[U] = ∑_{n} ∑_{μ,ν} β (1 - (1/N) Re Tr(U_∂p(n,μ,ν)))\n265 | \n266 | In the standard Wilson action, the sum is over unordered plaquette orientations\n267 | (μ < ν). The sum over all ordered pairs (μ,ν) double-counts each unoriented\n268 | plaquette; the coupling constant β can absorb this factor.\n269 | -/\n270 | noncomputable def wilsonActionFinite (N : ℕ) (β : ℝ) {Λ : Type} [AddVector Λ]\n271 |     (sites : Finset Λ) (U : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ) : ℝ :=\n272 |   ∑ n ∈ sites, ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν\n273 | \n274 | /--\n\n... 77 more line(s)